### Test Get User Applications
GET http://localhost:3111/applications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Get User Applications with Status Filter
GET http://localhost:3111/applications?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Get User Applications with Pagination
GET http://localhost:3111/applications?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json 